  (text "Half-duplex RS-485 on the bus pair. DE and /RE are tied: BUS_DE high = transmit. R22 keeps the driver off\nwhile the RP2350 boots. Close JP1 on the last bank only (120 ohm termination). The head unit needs a matching\ntransceiver plus the fail-safe bias resistors."
    (at 76.2 63.5 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.5 1.5))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "fd43316a-39eb-55be-8722-be8f0ef8f28e"))
